e ease of clean, worry-free, and <strong>happy mealtimes<\/strong> every day.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_yhBGKN","text_QwmY6f"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Baby_Mat_GIF_2_1.gif","video_autoplay":true,"video_loop":true,"height":"adapt","color_scheme":"background-1","section_color_scheme":"background-1","full_desktop_width":false,"content_layout":"no-overlap","desktop_media_width":50,"layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_full_media_width":false,"mobile_direction":"reverse","mobile_image_quanlity":"2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","mobile_padding_top":0,"mobile_padding_bottom":16,"desktop_padding_top":36,"desktop_padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#2e2a39","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_outline_button":"#dd1d1d","custom_section_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_section_gradient_background":""}},"testimonials_qBHNbX":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"column_fxHmgD":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>My baby actually enjoys mealtime now! The mat stays in place and keeps everything tidy.<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Ananya Verma, Delhi<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_pChNaL":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>No more food all over the table! The raised edges catch every spill — total game changer.<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Rohit Malhotra, Bangalore<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_3RpFi7":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>Safe, soft, and perfect for teething. My little one loves chewing on the edge while eating!<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Shweta Iyer, Mumbai<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_jUV3BK":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>Such a smart design. Portable, hygienic, and makes feeding time completely stress-free.<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Karan Deshpande, Chennai<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_a3MM6m":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>Cleaning is so easy — just rinse or toss it in the dishwasher. Every parent needs this<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Priya Nambiar, Hyderabad<\/strong><\/em>"}}},"block_order":["column_fxHmgD","column_pChNaL","column_3RpFi7","column_jUV3BK","column_a3MM6m"],"name":"Testimonials","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"💬What Parents Are Saying","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h1","text":"","color_scheme":"background-1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"square","column_alignment":"center","show_stars":true,"stars_color":"#ffd700","show_quotes":true,"quotes_color_scheme":"accent-2","cards_color_scheme":"bg-overlay","type":"loop","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":true,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":40,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":true,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","slider_mobile":true,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_adaptive_height":true,"mobile_dots_position":"under","mobile_arrows_position":"hidden","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2e2a39","custom_cards_colors_background":"#f3f3f3","custom_cards_gradient_background":"","custom_cards_colors_text":"#2e2a39"}},"image_with_text_94FMkB":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_D9rTkm":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"👶 Perfect For Which Age Group?","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_CwtcRC":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Safe and gentle <strong>for babies and toddlers from 6 months onwards<\/strong> — specially designed for early feeding and teething stages. The soft silicone surface, teething-friendly bumper, and non-slip base <strong>make mealtime comfortable<\/strong>, hygienic, and mess-free as your little one grows.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_D9rTkm","text_CwtcRC"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_62.png","video_autoplay":true,"video_loop":true,"height":"adapt","color_scheme":"background-1","section_color_scheme":"background-1","full_desktop_width":false,"content_layout":"no-overlap","desktop_media_width":50,"layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_full_media_width":false,"mobile_direction":"reverse","mobile_image_quanlity":"2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","mobile_padding_top":0,"mobile_padding_bottom":16,"desktop_padding_top":36,"desktop_padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#2e2a39","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_outline_button":"#dd1d1d","custom_section_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_section_gradient_background":""}},"collapsible_content_EUY8hK":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_CBpPJQ":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is it safe for babies?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Absolutely! This silicone placemat is made from 100% food-grade, BPA-free, and non-toxic silicone, making it perfectly safe for babies and toddlers. It’s soft, gentle on gums, and features a built-in teething edge for soothing comfort during meals.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_ACbDLQ":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Does it really prevent spills?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Yes! The placemat’s non-slip suction base and raised edge bumper keep food, bowls, and liquids from sliding or spilling off the table — making mealtimes clean, calm, and hassle-free.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_rrNJ9P":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is it easy to clean?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Very! Simply rinse with water, wipe clean, or place it directly in the dishwasher. The smooth, non-stick silicone surface resists stains, odors, and bacteria buildup.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_BRgTqC":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I use it for hot food?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Of course! The mat is heat and cold resistant (-40°C to 230°C) — safe for hot meals, warm bowls, and even freezer snacks.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_aiLYkH":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":" Is it travel-friendly?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Yes! The placemat is lightweight, flexible, and foldable, so you can easily roll it up and carry it in your diaper bag for outdoor meals, travel, or dining out.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_P6bJHE":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Do you offer Cash on Delivery?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Yes! We provide Cash on Delivery across India, along with secure prepaid payment options — so parents can shop safely and conveniently for this mealtime essential.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_QRkUNT":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is it durable for everyday use?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Definitely. Made with premium, thick silicone, it’s tear-resistant, long-lasting, and designed to handle daily use without losing shape or suction power.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_CBpPJQ","collapsible_row_ACbDLQ","collapsible_row_rrNJ9P","collapsible_row_BRgTqC","collapsible_row_aiLYkH","collapsible_row_P6bJHE","collap